use /lib

export shape TaskTableSentShape:
    description:
        A run can be sent more while it works. Each message sent to it is a
        row of its own, in order among what the harness did, where it was
        sent. Its Type is a "Sent" badge, and its Output the message's first
        line, the whole message as it was typed shown on hover. The rows after
        it are what the harness did in answer, until the next message. A Sent
        row has no status.

        A Sent row is never collapsed among the steps leading up to an
        answer.
